# - bytes: offset + length + data (right-zero-padded to 32-byte boundary)
# - string: same as bytes but UTF-8
# - T[k]: like k individual values
# - T[]: offset + length + T[k]
# - (T1,...,Tk): like k individual values (if all static) or with offsets (if any dynamic)

